This build: {{REF}}, commit {{SHA}}.
Complete source for this build, including Cargo.lock (which pins every
Rust dependency to an exact crates.io version):
  https://github.com/{{REPO}}/tree/{{SHA}}
The release page for a tagged version also carries the source archive.

Build it yourself (Windows, MSVC Rust toolchain):
  git clone https://github.com/{{REPO}}.git
  cd {{REPO_NAME}}
  git checkout {{SHA}}
  cargo build --locked --release

ffmpeg is NOT included. If you ship ffmpeg.exe with this program, you
must also ship its licence and offer its source (see README.txt).
